  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "30MM カラバリグランプリより、投票上位アイテムの「レヴェルノヴァ [ブラウン]」が登場！",
      "en": "From the 30MM Color Variation Grand Prix, the top voted item \"Level Nova [Brown]\" is now available!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 重装甲の機体を支える大ボリュームの脚部。",
      "en": "• Large volume legs that support the heavily armored aircraft."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 腰部に可動式のフロントアーマーを採用。",
      "en": "• Adopts a movable front armor at the waist."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 武装は高出力ライフルが付属。",
      "en": "• Armed with a high-power rifle."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 量産機同士の合体機構を搭載。別売りの「ガルドノヴァ」と合体すれば、重装甲機体を組み合わせて更に大型機体に。",
      "en": "• Equipped with a mechanism for combining mass-produced machines. If you combine it with \"Gardonova\" (sold separately), you can combine a heavily armored aircraft to create an even larger aircraft."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 既存機体やオプションパーツとのカスタマイズも可能。",
      "en": "• Can also be customized with existing aircraft and optional parts."
    }
